racterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕と彼女はそれから、今後のことを話し合っていた。\nその話し合いをしているうちに、日は沈んでしまった。","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第64スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 65","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_操夢.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.065.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.714761904761905,"animationName":"なし","id":"167E4690-7C24-4BA9-BA87-0AD47275DB1B","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"気がつけば、時刻は夜の9時を超えていた。\n「こんな夜分にまで、ありがとうございました。」","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第65スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 66","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_八雲紫.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.066.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.31750566893424,"animationName":"なし","id":"B5574153-0AC6-40DB-B14D-CACA4ACBE189","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"八雲紫","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","telop":"「いえいえ、貴方のご提案に、賛同させていただくことができ、ありがたいのこちらです。」私は、そう彼に返す。","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第66スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 67","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_操夢.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.067.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.227823129251701,"animationName":"なし","id":"DA2EB439-B118-445A-8F84-81B4F14C9417","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「それで、すでに条件として掲示していた、\n居住要件は満たせているでしょうか？」","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.8000000000000003,"slideTitle":"第67スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 68","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_八雲紫.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.068.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.80795918367347,"animationName":"なし","id":"3CC1B608-21D5-4D2E-9F06-B076CDF9C71A","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"八雲紫","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","telop":"「ええ、つい先ほど、小休憩中に連絡があり、私の手下たちは、皆撤退したとの、報告が上がってますので、ご安心ください。」","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第68スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 69","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.069.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.83,"animationName":"なし","id":"BC2BC189-B7E2-4278-88B8-CC68B42F86AF","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「そうですか…、ご対応ありがとうございます。\nそれで、これにて失礼させていただきます。」","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第69スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"title":"シーン 70","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_操夢.wav","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/キャラクター\/八雲紫\/八雲紫（バトルっぽい）\/通常\/紫（微笑）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.070.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.049546485260771,"animationName":"なし","id":"C3613FBB-14D0-44A9-ADA6-BB005C633E0A","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕はそう言うと、あの家に戻るために部屋を出た。","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第70スライド","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png"},{"characterName":"ナレーション","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.071.jpeg","slideTitle":"第71スライド","telop":"視点が再び変わり…","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","id":"DD9F0F8B-5E87-4403-8AC8-6603AD87019F","duration":3.5,"transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 71"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 72","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"B599F8CC-31C8-4959-B1D2-64BEF170392F","voiceDuration":8.823922902494331,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.072.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第72スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私は、彼女たちに、部屋を割り振り、この部屋を去った後、しばし考え込んでいた。「彼が、あそこまで急成長するとは…」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 73","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"CFCAF583-99A2-44C7-A1ED-7E73E3E67A4E","voiceDuration":8.823922902494331,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.073.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第73スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私は、彼女たちに、部屋を割り振り、この部屋を去った後、しばし考え込んでいた。「彼が、あそこまで急成長するとは…」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 74","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"4993887F-0C8F-4E85-BF8F-4E835083B88B","voiceDuration":8.834875283446712,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.074.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第74スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"そして、操作盤を触り、彼の情報を開く。いずれ彼は、彼女たちにとっても、この国にとっても欠かせない存在になる…"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 75","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"3F225634-16FD-477F-8858-E1EBC261C6C3","voiceDuration":7.30795918367347,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.075.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第75スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"そう感じさせるには、十分に値する情報量が、そこには表示されていた。すると、着信が入る。"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 76","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"99A15ADB-0653-4E6B-806E-3B0E2EA64BA7","voiceDuration":2.7604308390022676,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.076.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第76スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「彼の番号から着信です、出ますか？」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","title":"シーン 77","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","id":"0CE85DA7-23CE-4DCF-B70A-A5F381A698EA","voiceDuration":7.25390022675737,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.077.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第77スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「ええ、出て。」私がそう言い、着信に出ると、彼の声がする。\n「操夢さん、今どこにいますか？」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","title":"シーン 78","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","id":"4634CAFC-37F9-4B85-B56C-51EABBF0CF28","voiceDuration":7.449546485260771,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.078.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第78スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「あの、交渉の後、無事に帰宅できたので、霊夢さんたちに、家に帰れるようになったと、伝えてほしくて。」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 79","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"A539FDA3-549D-45AC-974B-B1A4EC7AB593","voiceDuration":3.6169387755102043,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.079.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第79スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「そうですか、それで、何か疲労とかは感じますか？」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","title":"シーン 80","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","id":"257669C0-1B60-4E6C-8BE9-3ABDBDC59D82","voiceDuration":6.85172335600907,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.080.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第80スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「ええ、結構溜まってます。それと、こんな夜中に霊夢さんたちに電話かけるのは好ましくはないので…」"},{"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 81","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","id":"E8A58CC5-DD94-4EED-893A-3D98882E0A1D","voiceDuration":3.4539002267573697,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.081.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第81スライド","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「そうですか、それで、彼女たちにはどう伝えます？」"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 82","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5.800000000000001,"animationName":"なし","id":"76D509AD-CE91-425A-92D7-54122159BDB7","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第82スライド","telop":"「彼女たちには、お昼の飛行機の予約とって、ポケベルにチケット送ったので、それを使って乗ってくれと言ってくれますか？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.082.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.776734693877551},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 83","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5,"animationName":"なし","id":"15691E5D-9FA9-481B-AE67-81AD772EC45B","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第83スライド","telop":"「そうですか、承知しました。では、失礼します。」\n私はそう言うと、通話を切る。そして、操作盤を触る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.083.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.597006802721088},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_084_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 84","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5.1000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","id":"BAA45BD5-720B-4C0B-B685-8C30E89C661D","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第84スライド","telop":"確かに、彼の言っていた通り、彼女たちの名前で座席がとってあるようだった。「しかもこれ…トップシート…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.084.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.2982086167800455},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_085_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 85","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5,"animationName":"なし","id":"A1EDDEA0-7494-48F9-B59F-9254D60DF3FC","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第85スライド","telop":"トップシートはYJAの中で最も運転室に近く、幅も広い、豪華で高価な席だ。「一体この出費はどこから…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.085.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.411904761904761},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_086_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 86","characterName":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5.5,"animationName":"なし","id":"96C7E162-D534-41B1-962A-E49536ABB075","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","slideTitle":"第86スライド","telop":"そして、あることを思い出す。そして、操作盤で調べると、霊夢さんが競馬で儲けたお金が充てがわれているようだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.086.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.993922902494331},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_087_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 87","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":3.7,"animationName":"なし","id":"B28940A2-0E2F-4DED-A62D-FACF4C808357","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第87スライド","telop":"私は、その始末を見て思わず、笑いをこぼす。\n「彼女の…自業自得ね…」っと。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.087.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.098458049886621},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_088_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 88","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","id":"0E58BE46-2C80-467F-A274-FB919EC27FFA","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice__DD8F","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第88スライド","telop":"そして、私は、操作盤から離れると、自室に向かった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.088.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.187596371882086},{"characterName":"","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.089.jpeg","slideTitle":"中扉","telop":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","id":"190B3109-358B-40AF-826F-E26B48AB2085","duration":3,"transitionName":"なし","title":"次回予告"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 90","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","duration":4.7,"animationName":"なし","id":"A6875DD4-F4EB-4E75-AF6D-69C55BB9D1BE","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第90スライド","telop":"僕は、その後よく眠り、一人目が覚めると、自室で朝食と身支度を済ませ、共同スペースに降りてくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.090.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.227823129251701},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_091_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 91","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","id":"312426A3-C66C-40BE-972E-3433746FDE38","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第91スライド","telop":"そして、ぼーっとしているのも暇だと感じ、ふらっと外に出る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.091.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.027823129251701},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_092_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 92","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":5.6000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","id":"5D93BA90-D8E1-4880-A728-F200FF189F22","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Documents\/動画用\/背景\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第92スライド","telop":"そして、その足取りのまま、着いたのは、空港だった。そして、空港を出歩いた後、到着ロビーで彼女たちを待つのだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.092.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.740861678004535},{"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","characterName":"","voiceCharacter":"","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8\/交換夫婦（27話目）_80789df3f8.093.jpeg","backgroundName":"単色背景","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","telop":"","duration":20,"slideTitle":"中扉","id":"ADB3BCCA-9FFD-4239-BE96-306A44F61BE0"}]